      <p class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-3xl text-center text-2xl font-semibold leading-snug text-gray-700">
        <span class="block">You started selling on WhatsApp to make money.</span>
        <span class="block">Not to do logistics manually all day.</span>
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="bg-white py-20 px-4" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <section aria-labelledby="how-heading">
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600">How TrustShip Works</p>
        <h2 id="how-heading" class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900">
          <span class="block">From WhatsApp message to</span>
          <span class="block">delivered order — automated.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-16 text-lg text-gray-600">
          Here is what happens after a buyer messages you:
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-8 right-8 top-5 z-0 hidden border-t-2 border-dashed border-indigo-200 md:block" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10 space-y-10 border-l-2 border-indigo-200 pl-8 md:grid md:grid-cols-5 md:gap-4 md:space-y-0 md:border-0 md:pl-0">
          <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center md:h-full">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-lg font-bold text-white">1</span>
            <span class="mt-3 mb-3 text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">💬</span>
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Buyer messages your shop code</h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
              Buyer sends their order to your WhatsApp number starting with your unique shop code. Hindi, English, Hinglish — any format works.
            </p>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-flex rounded-full bg-green-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-green-700">Instant</span>
          </div>

          <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center md:h-full">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-lg font-bold text-white">2</span>
            <span class="mt-3 mb-3 text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">🤖</span>
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">AI reads the order</h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
              Gemini AI extracts buyer name, phone, address, product, and amount from the raw message. No manual entry needed from you.
            </p>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-flex rounded-full bg-green-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-green-700">2 seconds</span>
          </div>

          <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center md:h-full">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-lg font-bold text-white">3</span>
            <span class="mt-3 mb-3 text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">🛡️</span>
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">4 gates verify the order</h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
              Address checked. Buyer risk scored. WhatsApp confirmation sent to buyer. Only clean confirmed orders proceed to shipping.
            </p>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-flex rounded-full bg-green-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-green-700">Automated</span>
          </div>

          <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center md:h-full">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-lg font-bold text-white">4</span>
            <span class="mt-3 mb-3 text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">📦</span>
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">You click Ship Now</h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
              One click creates the Delhivery shipment, generates AWB, downloads label, and notifies the buyer. No Delhivery account needed.
            </p>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-flex rounded-full bg-indigo-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-indigo-700">One click</span>
          </div>

          <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center md:h-full">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-lg font-bold text-white">5</span>
            <span class="mt-3 mb-3 text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">🚚</span>
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Buyer tracked automatically</h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
              Out for delivery alert with agent number. Delivery confirmation. RTO alert if returns. All via WhatsApp. Zero effort from you.
            </p>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-flex rounded-full bg-green-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-green-700">Automatic</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 flex justify-center">
        <%= link_to "Join Early Access →", new_seller_registration_path, class: "inline-flex rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-8 py-3 font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-indigo-700" %>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

