<div class="bg-white py-20 px-4">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <section aria-labelledby="rto-heading">
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-red-600">Stop losing money</p>
        <h2 id="rto-heading" class="mb-4 text-center text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900">
          <span class="block">Every RTO costs you ₹150+.</span>
          <span class="block">TrustShip stops most of them.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mb-16 max-w-2xl text-center text-lg text-gray-600">
          Return to Origin is the biggest hidden cost for WhatsApp sellers in India. Here is what it is costing you.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-6 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">What RTOs cost you every month</h3>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-red-100 bg-red-50 p-6">
            <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-red-100 py-3">
              <span>50 orders/month</span>
              <span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-red-100 py-3">
              <span>× 25% average RTO rate</span>
              <span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-red-100 py-3">
              <span>= 12 returned orders</span>
              <span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-red-100 py-3">
              <span>× ₹150 cost per RTO</span>
              <span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-2 flex justify-between pt-4">
              <span class="text-base font-semibold text-red-700">Lost every month</span>
              <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-600">₹1,800</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm italic text-gray-500">
            That's ₹21,600+ lost every year. Gone. For orders that were never real.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-6 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">How TrustShip stops them</h3>

          <div class="mb-6 flex gap-4">
            <span class="mt-1 flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-sm font-bold text-white">1</span>
            <div>
              <p class="mb-1 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Address Validation</p>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
                Bad pincode flagged before shipment is created. Undeliverable orders never reach Delhivery.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-6 flex gap-4">
